'''Rock Spiders''' are small spider-legged stones and they were added to ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]''. They behave very closely to {{E|Spider|text=Spiders}}, but they are exclusive to {{s|Mines}} and {{s|Ashpit}} and skitter at a slower speed.
Upon death, they turn into a normal {{E|Spider}}.

If Isaac is capable of breaking  [[rocks]] by stepping on them (e. g. with {{i|Leo}} or {{tf|Stompy}}), '''Rock Spiders''' will die if stepped on. This ''will'' spawn a Spider which is extremely likely to deal damage to Isaac.{{dlc-}}


