== Variants ==
=== Tinted Rock Spider ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Tinted Rock Spider
 | variant     = 1
 | base hp     = 22
 | environment = {{floor|Mines}}{{floor|Ashpit}}<br>Spawned exclusively from Tinted Rocks
 | behavior    = Quickly crawls around the room. If it sees Isaac, it crawls at him, trying to deal contact damage. Turns into a [[Soul Heart]] upon death. Can only spawn by breaking [[Rocks#Tinted Rocks|tinted rocks]] on [[Mines]] or [[Ashpit]].
}}

'''Tinted Rock Spiders''' are similar to Rock Spiders, however they have nearly twice as much health and move much faster. When killed, instead of transforming into a regular Spider, they drop 1 {{E|Soul Heart}} upon death. They are characterized by the "X" on their rock, which is similar to [[rocks#Tinted Rocks|Tinted Rocks]].

They do not spawn naturally; there is a chance that 1-2 will spawn upon destruction of a [[rocks#Tinted Rocks|Tinted Rock]] while in the {{s|Mines}} or {{s|Ashpit}}.

If killed by freezing, for example, with {{i|Uranus}} or {{i|Freezer Baby}}, the spider will not drop a soul heart.
{{clear}}

=== Coal Spider ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Coal Spider
 | variant     = 2
 | base hp     = 15
 | environment = {{floor|Burning Basement}}<br>{{floor|Mines}}{{floor|Ashpit}}
 | behavior    = Quickly crawls around the room. If it sees Isaac, it crawls at him, trying to deal contact damage. Turns into a hot coal upon death that blocks shots and deals contact damage, but can be destroyed.
}}

'''Coal Spiders''' behave very closely to Rock Spiders, but they skitter at a faster speed due to being on fire.

Upon death, it leaves a hot rock on the ground that despawns after several seconds. They can be shot to make them despawn faster.

Rock Spiders coming into contact with a {{E|Fire Place}} or fire spawned by items, such as {{i|Red Candle}} or {{i|Bird's Eye}}, turn into Coal Spiders.

Unlike Rock Spiders, Coal Spiders cannot be killed by stepping on them while having a {{tf|Stompy}} effect.
{{clear}}

